Myfanwy,

I'm not sure if this is what you want or not, but perhaps this helps get there:

ggplot(x, aes(x = Rkm, y = trunc(DateTimeUTC, "days"), fill = factor(Sp), group = interaction(Rkm,Sp))) + geom_violin(position = "identity")

The resulting violins are extremely thin though. Doesn't show a whole lot at this scale. I trunc(ated) at day so they would clump together better and used group to clump things together. Then put the position right over the value in the chart.

HTH,
Brandon

