Hi- I am brand new to R so forgive my inexperience. I have daily rainfall data for 45 years in the form below (value = rainfall amt)

Ano Mes Dia value       date
1 1967   8   1    NA 1967-08-01
2 1967   9   1  11.0 1967-09-01
