Hi Alyssa again

As for question 2), the following should be "close" to what you want.

numDays50 =
function(values)
{
   sv = sort(values)/sum(values)
   sum( cumsum(sv)  >= .5 )
}

tapply(d$value, d$Ano, numDays50)

D.

